/A 9078 0 R
/Alt (The Morse code for the phrase \215hi there\216 begins with four dots for the H and two dots for the I. A pause follows to signal a new word: A dash for the T, four dots for the H, a dot for the E, a dot-dash-dot for the R, and ending with another dot for the E.)
